<title>USA: Great Lakes says Bio-Lab completes sale.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes says Bio-Lab completes sale.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Chemical Corp said its Bio-Lab Inc unit completed the sale of its BLN wholesale distribution business to SCP Pool Corp for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>In the second part of a two-part transaction, the company said Bio-Lab will acquire SCP's Alliance Packaging affiliate. The second part of the deal is expected to be consummated in late October, Great Lakes said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
